{% comment %}
  Renders a chat-style meta line above a product card's title: a "sent Xm
  ago" timestamp plus a rotating social/stock signal. Decorative flavor for
  the group-chat world — aria-hidden so screen readers hear only the real
  title and price. Deterministic per product id (no layout shift, no random
  seed needed) so it's stable between renders; wire to real analytics or
  remove once real content/data exists.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign signals = 'seen by 1.2k|read by 3.4k|screenshotted 89x|sent to the group chat|going around rn' | split: '|'
  assign signal_index = product.id | modulo: signals.size
  assign signal = signals[signal_index]
  assign minutes = product.id | modulo: 58 | plus: 2
-%}
<p class="memeup-bubble-meta" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="memeup-bubble-meta__time">{{ minutes }}m</span>
  <span class="memeup-bubble-meta__dot">&middot;</span>
  <span class="memeup-bubble-meta__signal">{{ signal }}</span>
</p>
